allegiant stadium has been a hot topic  lately and last night while wwe's  summerslam was taking place reports have  downed concession stands blinding lights  and parking costs took center stage good  evening and thank you so much for  joining us tonight at midnight i'm sasha  loftis madison kimbrough is live from  the stadium with the latest on what some  are saying about this and to break down  the cause of these issues madison  i spoke to two people who attended last  night's event and while they were  pleased with summerslam it was the  cashless payment system outage that was  the talk of the night here at allegiant  stadium  some lights that surrounded  the ring at some point they had gotten  turned up to the point to where we  couldn't even really visibly see the  ring you know that's a disappointment  you know because i felt like we had  pretty good seats we were lower level  those that attended saturday night's wwe  summerslam 2021 got quite the show but  the main chatter was about the  concession stands being closed leaving  fans without food or water available  there was a group of employees standing  there and i said you know  do you guys have just a water cup my  father-in-law is diabetic and he said  no everything very rude everything's  shut down  everything's closed the fountains don't  work turns out the stadium's official  cashless payment system went down during  the wrestling match and it wasn't just  at allegiant stadium as there was an  outage nationwide it was resolved later  saturday night the company total system  services also known as tsys is a united  states credit card processor and they  have yet to comment on the matter but  another company called shift 4 payments  tweeted out that they are in close  contact with tsys to facilitate a  resolution as quickly as possible  meanwhile both attendees we spoke to  were frustrated but both agreed that  this wasn't an allegiant stadium issue  and it won't stop them from attending  upcoming events in the future even  though we had some issues this doesn't  really stop that we're not mad at you  know  anyone at allegiant stadium is just you  know our situation just wasn't the best  we reached out to allegiant stadium and  wwe for a comment on last night's issues  we have yet to hear back reporting live  madison kimbrough 8 news now
 

